<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="description" content="Nunjucks engine — template inheritance, globals, and the forward pipe filter operator.">
  <title>{{ appName }} — Home</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 720px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 0 24px; color: #2c3e50; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.6rem; }
    dl { margin: 24px 0; }
    dt { font-weight: 600; color: #3498db; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    dd { margin: 4px 0 0; }
    code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; background: #f3f4f6; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; }
    a { color: #3498db; }
    footer { color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #ecf0f1; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Welcome, {{ username }}</h1>
  <p>The smallest end-to-end demo: <code>{% extends %}</code>, <code>{{ '{{ appName }}' }}</code>, <code>{% for %}</code>, and a custom filter via the forward pipe operator.</p>

  <dl>
    <dt>Globals</dt>
    <dd><code>{{ '{{ appName }} v{{ version }}' }}</code> → <strong>{{ appName }} v{{ version }}</strong></dd>
    <dt>Function global</dt>
    <dd><code>{{ '{{ getYear() }}' }}</code> → <strong>{{ getYear() }}</strong></dd>
    <dt>Pipe filter</dt>
    <dd><code>{{ '{{ "hello" |> shout }}' }}</code> → <strong>{{ "hello" |> shout }}</strong></dd>
  </dl>

  <footer><a href="/">← Back to index</a> · Renders through <code>nunjucks(config)</code></footer>
</body>
</html>